WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:32.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:32.682 --> 00:00:38.224
The spotlight's dead, the cables coiled

00:00:40.565 --> 00:00:45.887
The magic trick has been completely spoiled

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:52.129
Just an echo bouncing off the concrete floor

00:00:56.455 --> 00:01:02.000
No one's knocking at the backstage door

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:10.500
Empty arenas, where the echoes go to die

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:18.800
Empty arenas, beneath a painted sky

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:23.500
We used to set this room on fire

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:28.000
Now we're just preaching to the wire

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:33.500
In these empty arenas

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:47.000
[Instrumental Break]

00:01:47.726 --> 00:01:51.389
The ticket stubs are swept away

00:01:53.891 --> 00:02:01.538
Just ghosts remembering yesterday

00:02:01.898 --> 00:02:06.942
I look out at the velvet seats

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:17.500
And listen to my own heartbeat

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:24.800
Empty arenas, where the echoes go to die

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:33.500
Empty arenas, beneath a painted sky

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:38.200
We used to set this room on fire

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:43.000
Now we're just preaching to the wire

00:02:43.643 --> 00:02:49.448
In these empty arenas

00:02:51.009 --> 00:02:57.000
Will the lights ever come back on?

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:02.283
Or is the final encore already gone?

00:03:04.524 --> 00:03:13.000
If I scream into the vast unknown

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:18.254
Will I realize I'm all alone?

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:51.500
[Guitar Solo]

00:03:52.126 --> 00:03:59.500
Empty arenas, where the echoes go to die

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:08.500
Empty arenas, beneath a painted sky

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:13.200
We used to set this room on fire

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:17.278
Now we're just preaching to the wire

00:04:17.298 --> 00:04:26.080
In these empty arenas

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:34.000
Just preaching to the wire...

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:43.000
Empty...

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:57.500
[Outro]
